# Netlist / Connection spec (草稿)

# Netlist / Connection spec (草稿) - 便于在 KiCad 中建图
# Format: Module | Reference | Pin/Signal | NetName | Notes

Power:
- POWER | J1_PWR | VIN+ | VIN_12V | 外接 12V 输入
- POWER | J1_PWR | GND  | GND_IN  | 外部地/机箱地可单独 CHASSIS_GND
- PWR   | LDO_AUD | IN   | VIN_12V | LDO_AUDIO 输入
- PWR   | LDO_AUD | OUT  | V_AUDIO | 模拟电源，用于 TDA7439
- PWR   | LDO_3V3| IN   | VIN_12V | LDO_3V3 输入
- PWR   | LDO_3V3| OUT  | V_3V3   | MCU 与逻辑

MCU (STM32F103C8T6, LQFP48) (symbol: U1)
- U1 | PA9  | USART1_TX | TXD |
- U1 | PA10 | USART1_RX | RXD |
- U1 | PB6  | I2C1_SCL   | I2C_SCL |
- U1 | PB7  | I2C1_SDA   | I2C_SDA |
- U1 | PA0  | EXTI0/IR   | IR_IN |
- U1 | PA8  | ENC_A      | ENC_A |
- U1 | PA9  | ENC_B      | ENC_B (注意：如果 PA9 已用 TXD，可改用 TIM2/EXTI pin)
- U1 | PC13 | BTN_PUSH   | BTN1 |
- U1 | PA13 | SWDIO      | SWDIO |
- U1 | PA14 | SWCLK      | SWCLK |
- U1 | VDD  | 3.3V       | V_3V3 |
- U1 | VSS  | GND        | GND_DIGITAL

Audio IC (TDA7439) (symbol: U2)
- U2 | SCL  | SCL        | I2C_SCL | Pullups 4.7k to V_3V3
- U2 | SDA  | SDA        | I2C_SDA |
- U2 | MUTE | MUTE_CTRL  | MUTE_CTRL | MCU PC0 控制 (active 根据 datasheet)
- U2 | RESET| RESET_CTRL | RESET_CTRL | MCU PC1 (或 tie-up)
- U2 | IN1L | IN1L       | RCA_IN_1_L_NODE |
- U2 | IN1R | IN1R       | RCA_IN_1_R_NODE |
- U2 | IN2L | IN2L       | RCA_IN_2_L_NODE |
- U2 | IN2R | IN2R       | RCA_IN_2_R_NODE |
- U2 | IN3L | IN3L       | RCA_IN_3_L_NODE |
- U2 | IN3R | IN3R       | RCA_IN_3_R_NODE |
- U2 | OUTL | OUTL       | TDA_OUT_L |
- U2 | OUTR | OUTR       | TDA_OUT_R |
- U2 | VCC  | V_AUDIO    | V_AUDIO |
- U2 | GND  | GND_ANALOG | GND_ANALOG

Audio inputs (per RCA)
- J_RCA_IN1 | L | CENTER -> FB -> R100 -> C2.2uF -> RCA_IN_1_L_NODE -> Rpull 10k -> GND_ANALOG
- J_RCA_IN1 | R | CENTER -> ... -> RCA_IN_1_R_NODE
(similar for IN2/IN3)

Audio outputs
- TDA_OUT_L -> C_out 4.7uF -> BUF_IN_L (MCP6002 IN+)
- TDA_OUT_R -> C_out 4.7uF -> BUF_IN_R
- BUF_OUT_L -> RCA_OUT_L
- BUF_OUT_R -> RCA_OUT_R

I2C peripherals
- I2C_SCL/I2C_SDA -> SSD1306 SCL/SDA (I2C address 0x3C typical)
- I2C pullups: R_PU1 4.7k (to V_3V3), R_PU2 4.7k

IR Receiver
- J_IR | VCC -> V_3V3
- J_IR | GND -> GND_DIGITAL
- J_IR | OUT -> IR_IN (PA0) with 10k pull-up to V_3V3

Op-amp (MCP6002) U3
- U3 | V+ -> V_3V3 (if single 3.3V op amp used) OR V_AUDIO if op amp needs different rail
- U3 | V- -> GND
- U3 | IN+ -> TDA_OUT_x (via coupling cap)
- U3 | IN- -> feedback network (e.g., 10k/10k -> unity gain or slight gain)
- U3 | OUT -> RCA_OUT_x

Connectors & Test
- J_SWD: SWDIO (PA13), SWCLK (PA14), GND, VCC (3.3V)
- TP: Testpoints for V_3V3, V_AUDIO, I2C_SCL, I2C_SDA, TDA_OUT_L, TDA_OUT_R, GND
